#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/channels.rst:2
msgid "The Channels view"
msgstr "Prikaz Kanali"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/channels.rst:4
msgid ""
"A product's script can publish named values and controls over the debug "
"protocol -- a reading, a detection count, a microphone waveform, a depth "
"map, a switch or a threshold the operator may change -- and the *Channels* "
"view, selected from the pane below the frame buffer, shows them live. "
"Readouts and controls appear as labels, toggles, sliders, spin boxes, radio "
"buttons, selectors, text fields, and buttons; changing a control sends the "
"new value to the script. Waveforms appear as scrolling graphs, with a "
"spectrum mode and triggers; depth maps appear as false-colour images with a "
"choice of palette, scaling, and tone mapping. Any graph or map can be "
"recorded to a CSV, WAV, NumPy, or Edge Impulse file, and the last values "
"stay on screen when the script stops."
msgstr ""
"Skripta proizvoda može objavljivati imenovane vrijednosti i kontrole preko "
"protokola za ispravljanje pogrešaka -- očitanje, broj detekcija, valni oblik"
" mikrofona, kartu dubine, prekidač ili prag koji operater smije mijenjati --"
" a prikaz *Kanali*, odabran iz okna ispod međuspremnika slike, prikazuje ih "
"uživo. Očitanja i kontrole pojavljuju se kao oznake, prekidači, klizači, "
"brojčani okviri, radijski gumbi, birači, tekstna polja i gumbi; promjena "
"kontrole šalje novu vrijednost skripti. Valni oblici pojavljuju se kao "
"pomični grafovi, sa spektralnim načinom i okidačima; karte dubine pojavljuju"
" se kao slike u lažnim bojama s izborom palete, skaliranja i mapiranja "
"tonova. Svaki graf ili karta može se snimiti u CSV, WAV, NumPy ili Edge "
"Impulse datoteku, a posljednje vrijednosti ostaju na zaslonu kad se skripta "
"zaustavi."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/channels.rst:20
msgid ""
"The Channels view showing a thermal camera script's controls channel: FPA "
"and AUX temperature readouts with their unit, Measurement and High Temp "
"toggles, Temp Min and Temp Max sliders, and H-Mirror and V-Flip toggles"
msgstr ""
"Prikaz Kanali koji prikazuje kanal kontrola skripte termalne kamere: "
"očitanja temperature FPA i AUX sa svojom jedinicom, prekidači Measurement i "
"High Temp, klizači Temp Min i Temp Max te prekidači H-Mirror i V-Flip"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/channels.rst:20
msgid ".. image:: ../ide/figures/channels-controls.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../ide/figures/channels-controls.png"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/channels.rst:24
msgid "A thermal camera script's controls as the Channels view renders them."
msgstr "Kontrole skripte termalne kamere kako ih prikaz Kanali iscrtava."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/channels.rst:27
msgid ""
"The view is the same one OpenMV IDE has; its :doc:`Channels view "
"<../ide/channels>` page covers every control, the graph and map tools, and "
"recording in detail."
msgstr ""
"Prikaz je isti kao u OpenMV IDE-u; njegova stranica :doc:`prikaz Kanali "
"<../ide/channels>` detaljno pokriva svaku kontrolu, alate za grafove i karte"
" te snimanje."
